    "body": "Firefox never reaches that step in the cross-origin download attr case.  I think we effectively take the \"Follow the hyperlink\" path at https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-a-element:downloading-hyperlinks-2 based on the cross-origin nature of the link and what we interpret \"user preference\" to be in our case.  Yes, that's pretty weasel-wordy.  ",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
